{: #sec-lifecycle}
# Discovery Ecosystem Lifecycle

   *  Registration and management of an entity to be discovered.

   *  Search based on a formalised encoding of search criteria.

   *  Discovery lookup based on a minimum viable dataset (protocol,
      identifying properties) with return of a set of minimum
      discoverable information (including reachability).

   *  Reading of additional information.

   *  Capability exchange and negotiation.

